The focused failure is now closed: a mid-write socket error returns a lane-scoped `connectionLost`, teardown completes, and all custom allocations return to zero. The expanded integration suite is still running; its slower pressure cases are exercising 64 concurrent exit waiters plus 32 concurrent close callers, so I’m letting that evidence complete rather than weakening the test.
